---
description: Design system and accessibility
globs: Sunnies/Presentation/**/*.swift
---
- Use `SunniesColor`, `SunniesTypography`, `SunniesSpacing`, `SunniesRadius`, `sunniesShadow` — no raw colors, font sizes, or magic spacing.
- Brand: primary-400 #F8E11A (Paris daisy yellow) as button fill with `onAccent` text; dark background primary-950 #2A1C04. Use `accent` (not raw yellow) for text/icons so light mode keeps contrast.
- Reuse `StateView` for loading/empty/error, `ConfidenceBadge` for confidence, the `.sunnies*` button styles.
- Dynamic Type text styles only; 44pt minimum tap targets; VoiceOver labels on every control.
- Confidence is never conveyed by color alone. Never render `matchScore` as a number.
- Editorial, calm, image-led. Avoid dashboard or cluttered marketplace patterns.
